tional and industrial building systems. In addition, the company provides general trading, construction, mechanical and electrical maintenance, and care and improvement services; landscaping work and general contractors; facility management services and fund-raising vehicle; and concession business. The company was formerly known as Ideal Jacobs (Malaysia) Corporation Bhd. and changed its name to Widad Group Berhad in December 2018. Widad Group Berhad is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia."}}